WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:04.380
A sign of hope for Rahaf Mohammed al-Qunun.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:09.490
These pictures show the young Saudi woman
leaving the airport in Bangkok, together with

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.830
officials from the UN refugee agency.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:19.890
The UNHCR will assess whether she can be granted
refugee status, protecting her from deportation.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:24.099
This marks a pause in a tense stand-off that
began on Saturday.

00:00:24.099 --> 00:00:26.410
Al-Qunun arrived from Kuwait, where she was
staying with her family.

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:27.410
She was stopped at immigration.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:37.020
She says her passport was taken from her,
and officials tried to send her back to Kuwait.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:41.980
The 18-year-old then barricaded herself an
airport hotel room.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:46.980
She drew attention to her plight on social
media, quickly gathering tens of thousands

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.610
of followers.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:55.190
She said she feared for life, after her family
threatened her for renouncing Islam and cutting

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:57.300
her hair.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.190
I'm not leaving my room until I see UNHCR.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:05.150
I want asylum.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:14.490
The Thai authorities then seemed to perform
a dramatic about-face, allowing a top UN official

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:22.540
to see her."We strongly advocated with the
Thai government and we received reassurances

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:45.430
that pending the completion of 
the assessment

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:52.540
and any decision, she will not be sent back.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:02:04.080
Today, the UNHCR representative is personally
here.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:32.840
He has told me that he will take no more than
five days from now to give her asylum status

00:02:32.840 --> 00:03:15.999
and

00:03:15.999 --> 00:03:27.779
send 
her on to a third country.

00:03:27.779 --> 00:03:53.540
Al-Qunun now says she feels safe - despite
the arrival in the Thailand of

00:03:53.540 --> 00:04:18.750
her father, who's a senior Saudi

00:04:18.750 --> 00:05:56.740
government official.

00:05:56.740 --> 00:06:07.280
Her

00:06:07.280 --> 00:07:06.719
case has 
once again brought international attention

00:07:06.719 --> 00:07:33.789
to the kingdom, and the 
obstacles

00:07:33.789 --> 00:08:27.380
that women face there.

